{"cover":{"src":"audio/noah/cover.m4a","text":"Noah's Ark.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":2.25,"words":[{"w":"Noah's","s":0.7,"e":1},{"w":"Ark.","s":1,"e":1.575}]},"walked-title":{"src":"audio/noah/walked-title.m4a","text":"Part One. A Man Who Walked with God.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.725,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.85},{"w":"One","s":0.85,"e":1.325},{"w":"A","s":1.462,"e":1.575},{"w":"Man","s":1.575,"e":1.812},{"w":"Who","s":1.812,"e":1.95},{"w":"Walked","s":1.95,"e":2.237},{"w":"with","s":2.237,"e":2.4},{"w":"God","s":2.4,"e":3.125}]},"walked-0":{"src":"audio/noah/walked-0.m4a","text":"Long after the first days, the world had filled up with people — but it had also filled up with fighting and wrong. People hurt one another, and the earth was spoiled.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":11.175,"words":[{"w":"Long","s":0.675,"e":1},{"w":"after","s":1,"e":1.262},{"w":"the","s":1.262,"e":1.363},{"w":"first","s":1.363,"e":1.7},{"w":"days","s":1.7,"e":2.325},{"w":"the","s":2.4,"e":2.538},{"w":"world","s":2.538,"e":2.862},{"w":"had","s":2.862,"e":3.038},{"w":"filled","s":3.038,"e":3.312},{"w":"up","s":3.312,"e":3.487},{"w":"with","s":3.487,"e":3.65},{"w":"people","s":3.65,"e":4.375},{"w":"but","s":4.45,"e":4.588},{"w":"it","s":4.588,"e":4.662},{"w":"had","s":4.662,"e":4.775},{"w":"also","s":4.775,"e":5.175},{"w":"filled","s":5.175,"e":5.463},{"w":"up","s":5.463,"e":5.638},{"w":"with","s":5.638,"e":5.825},{"w":"fighting","s":5.825,"e":6.325},{"w":"and","s":6.325,"e":6.45},{"w":"wrong","s":6.45,"e":7.3},{"w":"People","s":7.487,"e":7.85},{"w":"hurt","s":7.85,"e":8.125},{"w":"one","s":8.125,"e":8.287},{"w":"another","s":8.287,"e":8.85},{"w":"and","s":8.95,"e":9.062},{"w":"the","s":9.062,"e":9.188},{"w":"earth","s":9.188,"e":9.525},{"w":"was","s":9.525,"e":9.688},{"w":"spoiled","s":9.688,"e":10.6}]},"walked-1":{"src":"audio/noah/walked-1.m4a","text":"But one man was different. His name was Noah. Noah was good, he loved God, and he walked w